{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1489804-w20-kinfolk-book-and-fianna-gifts","id":1489804,"title":"W20 Kinfolk Book and Fianna Gifts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-11T16:10:17-07:00","id":1489804,"title":"W20 Kinfolk Book and Fianna Gifts","content":"So, one of my players noticed a strange oversight today; the W20 Kinfolk book lists no Tribal Gifts for Fianna. Every other tribe has at least a couple of Gifts, even the Red Talons and Stargazers, but not the Fianna. Bizarre. Was this accidental?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-11T17:43:16-07:00","id":1489820,"title":"","content":"I think a lot of it is that the level 1 Fianna Gifts can be learned by Kinfolk (they don't require Garou specific traits or the Gnosis Merit) as it is. A bunch of the KABA Gifts are basically lesser versions of normal Gifts that don't use Rage or Gnosis so Kin can use them effectively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T15:46:54-07:00","id":1490191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1489804-w20-kinfolk-book-and-fianna-gifts?p=1489820#post1489820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think a lot of it is that the level 1 Fianna Gifts can be learned by Kinfolk (they don't require Garou specific traits or the Gnosis Merit) as it is. A bunch of the KABA Gifts are basically lesser versions of normal Gifts that don't use Rage or Gnosis so Kin can use them effectively.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmmm. Fair. Makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}